	(text "PCB connectivity reconstructed from the current candidate.\nPower targets are requirements, NOT measured/default outputs.\nRead POWER_REVIEW_CN.md before ordering PCBA.\nTF default ON: PH12 low or Hi-Z = ON; high = OFF.\nDisplay RESET = PA8; TE = PA9; both share the 1V8 domain.\nWake timer: approx 3 s nominal; measure 2.2-3.8 s.\nUSB routed as a pair; see USB_ROUTING_REPAIR_CN.md.\nUSB impedance / MIPI / display power still require validation."
